## Get started

Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/), then run:

```bash
make install
uv run python experiments/example.py
```

Without `make` (for example on Windows), run `uv sync` and
`uv run pre-commit install` instead of `make install`.

Put scripts in `experiments/` and notebooks in `notebooks/`.

## Develop

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `make check` | Lint, format, and type checks |
| `make test` | Run tests |
| `make format` | Format code and apply safe lint fixes |

Add dependencies with `uv add package-name`, or `uv add --dev tool-name`
for development tools. Commit `pyproject.toml` and `uv.lock` together.

